            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "mara"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made this because we wanted something different to drink. A big hit. Used lemon vodka and regular vodka with the lemonade let it set for an hour and added berries like recommend. Will make this again",
            "datePublished": "2016-07-17T04:19:16.233Z"
          },
